Package: dataeuropa
Title: Access the 'data.europa.eu' European Open Data Portal
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person("Nigel", "Randsley", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "nigel.randsley@protonmail.com")
Description: Search, retrieve and download open data from the European data
    portal <https://data.europa.eu> through its Search API, Registry API and
    SPARQL endpoint. Returns data frames of datasets, distributions and facets.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/randsley/dataeuropa, https://randsley.github.io/dataeuropa/r/
BugReports: https://github.com/randsley/dataeuropa/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: httr2 (>= 1.1.0), jsonlite, openssl
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), withr, callr, readxl, arrow, sf
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
